   2                                                                                                                                       ▮
   3 ─ Moving ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────▮
   4    h j k l                       move (never off the line)                                                                            ▮
   5    w b e W B E                   word / WORD motions                                                                                  ▮
   6    zz zt zb                      center/top/bottom the cursor line                                                                     
   7    H M L                         top/middle/bottom visible line                                                                        
   8    g;                            older change (changelist)                                                                             
   9    g,                            newer change (changelist)                                                                             
  10    ge gE { }                     word-end back / paragraph motions                                                                     
  11    0 $ G %                       line/file/pair jumps                                                                                  
  12    g<space>                      collection: open full source at caret                                                                 
  13    gg                            top of file                                                                                           
  14    enter                         line down, first non-blank (blame gutter: dive)                                                       
  15    tab                           jump list forward (ctrl-i)                                                                            
  16    ctrl-d ctrl-u ctrl-f ctrl-b   half/full page scroll (count = lines)                                                                 
  17    ctrl-^                        alternate buffer                                                                                      
  18    gr                            references (LSP)                                                                                      
  19    gI                            implementation (LSP)                                                                                  
  20    gy                            type definition (LSP)                                                                                 
  21    gD                            declaration (LSP)                                                                                     
  22    ]d                            next diagnostic                                                                                       
  23    [d                            previous diagnostic                                                                                   
  24    gd                            goto definition (LSP)                                                                                 
  25    gs                            switch source/header (clangd)                                                                         
  26    f<c> F<c> t<c> T<c>           find/till char (candidates light up)                                                                  
  27    ]f                            next file card (collections)                                                                          
  28    [f                            previous file card (collections)                                                                      
  29    ]e                            next excerpt (collections; +/- context)                                                               
  30    [e                            previous excerpt (collections; +/- context)                                                           
  31    ]c                            next git hunk                                                                                         
  32    [c                            previous git hunk                                                                                     
  33    m<a>                          set mark at cursor                                                                                    
  34    '<a> `<a>                     jump to mark                                                                                          
  35    ; ,                           repeat find, same / reversed                                                                          
  36    |                             column motion (vim); pipe moved to space |                                                            
  37    ^ _                           first non-blank                                                                                       
